; RIFT BOSS POOL (sl-0180): BOOMERANG VEIL — four bolts fan out for
; 36 ticks at 5.5 t/s then come BACK along their own axes at 4.5
; (the BOOMERANG program's first hostile use; CORE-32: the return is
; axis-bound, never homing). The safe ground flips sides mid-volley —
; playful, deterministic, bot-projected. Pattern id 33; lead 30 (the
; fan danger class — the return pays the generous lead). Elite amber.

